pkl-rs

An independent Rust implementation project targeting Pkl 0.32.0 compatibility.

The reference repositories in external/pkl and external/pkl-pantry are maintained
by Apple Inc. and the Pkl project authors. Their original licenses, notices, and
third-party notices are retained in the pinned submodules. Preserve the relevant
notices when importing source code or test assets into this repository.

The shared constraint diagnostics and value rendering in
crates/pkl-runtime/src/power_assertions.rs and diagnostic_values.rs adapt
algorithms from Pkl 0.32.0 PowerAssertions.java, VmValueRenderer.java, and
ValueFormatter.java, rewritten in Rust for the shared VM.
